settings {
  bExposeToLibrary = true
  Description = "A garment\'s stitches, laid over its cloth (GC-GARMENT-STITCH.md §5). Put before a material\'s outputs: the cloth\'s base colour, normal, roughness and occlusion in, the same with its stitches out. The stitch sheet arrives as StitchColour, StitchNormal and StitchMask, read on UV2; their defaults draw nothing."
}

